    narr:narration """As of August 2026, a new deployment control is in effect for Meridian, mandating that every release requires a [signed release manifest](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) prior to shipment. This requirement is [formally scoped](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) to cover both staging and production environments. The gate is [explicitly owned](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) by Quinton Fairweather, who frames the implementation as a direct [response to a specific failure](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) involving two unsigned artifacts that reached staging in the previous quarter. The documentation maintains a [consistent technical summary](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) of the policy, emphasizing its role in conservation and operational competence.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release manifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging last quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The policy is framed as a rigid, authority-backed mandate, contrasting with the plain-spoken, reactive explanation of the underlying failure." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
